' bmsync — code call graph (class level, server + extension core)
' Server class/file names come from knowledge-graph class scan; extension side from extension/lib.
' Arrow A --> B means A calls B. Dashed lines are data/type dependencies only, no call.

@startuml call-graph
title bmsync code call graph (class level)

package "BookmarkSync.Cli" {
  class Cli
  class Program
}
package "BookmarkSync.Server" {
  class BmsyncServer
  class ApiEndpoints
  class Auth
  class RateLimiter
  class ServerOptions
  class Healthcheck
  class HttpJson
}
package "BookmarkSync.Store" {
  class BookmarkStore
  class FileOps
  class StoreOptions
}
package "BookmarkSync.Domain" {
  class Merger
  class State
  class Hlc
  class TombstoneGc
  class Limits
  class BmsyncJson
}

Program --> Cli : Main
Cli --> BmsyncServer : Build(cfg)
Cli --> Healthcheck : healthcheck subcommand
BmsyncServer --> BookmarkStore : CreateAsync (eager creation)
BmsyncServer --> ApiEndpoints : MapGet/MapPost
ApiEndpoints --> Auth : (via middleware) Protect
Auth --> RateLimiter : allow(ip)
Auth --> ServerOptions : Token
ApiEndpoints --> HttpJson : ReadBody/WriteJson/WriteError
ApiEndpoints --> State : Validate()
ApiEndpoints --> BookmarkStore : SyncAsync / Get*Count / GetConflicts / ListSnapshots
BookmarkStore --> Merger : Merge(server, incoming, base, device, now)
BookmarkStore --> TombstoneGc : CollectFrom
BookmarkStore --> Hlc : _clock.Update (server clock)
BookmarkStore --> FileOps : atomic write/snapshot/read-back
BookmarkStore --> StoreOptions : DataDir/HistoryKeep/TombstoneTtl
Merger --> Hlc : Compare/ObserveMany (LWW decision + causality)
Merger --> State : SortedUnionKeys/SameContent/invariants
State ..> BmsyncJson : serialization (omitempty + key ordering aligned)

package "extension/lib (JS, no build)" {
  class runSync
  class collect
  class apply
  class client
  class keys
  class HLC
}
runSync --> collect : scan/buildState (collect + tombstones)
runSync --> client : sync/healthCheck (report)
runSync --> apply : planApply/executePlan (apply authoritative state)
collect --> keys : identity derivation (bookmark u: / folder f:+NUL)
client ..> runSync : SyncError (non-200 throws, local untouched)
HLC ..> Hlc : byte-for-byte identical (hlc_vectors.json shared by all three sides)

note bottom of Merger
  To change merging touch only Merger + matching MergeTests;
  to change the protocol also look at ApiTypes.cs and collect.js
end note
@enduml
